e:"Do\u2018st ikki sekundda to\u2018laydi.",step6Text:"Havolani ochdi, ulushini ko\u2018rdi, karta bilan to\u2018ladi. Hech narsa o\u2018rnatmadi.",step7Label:"07 \xb7 HOLAT",step7Title:"Hammasi real vaqtda ko\u2018rinadi.",step7Text:"Kim to\u2018ladi, kim ochdi, kimga eslatish kerak.",step8Label:"08 \xb7 KESHBEK",step8Title:"Butun guruhga keshbek \xd72.",step8Text:"Birga to\u2018ladingiz \u2014 bonusni har kim oladi.",marquee:"SKAN \xb7 BO\u2018L \xb7 HAVOLA \xb7 KESHBEK \xd72 \xb7 O\u2018RNATMASDAN \xb7 PAYME \xb7 CLICK \xb7 UZCARD \xb7 HUMO \xb7 ",reasonsTitle:"Bu ishlashining to\u2018rtta sababi.",reason1Title:"Ilova \u2014 faqat tashabbuskorga.",reason1Text:"Qatnashchilar SMS havolasi bilan to\u2018laydi. Kirish to\u2018sig\u2018i nol.",reason2Title:"Qarzlar o\u2018zi yopiladi.",reason2Text:"Qarzga oldi \u2014 ZAP! eslab qoladi va qaytarganda yechadi. Eslatish shart emas.",reason3Title:"Mahalliy to\u2018lov yo\u2018llari.",reason3Text:"Payme, Click, Uzcard va Humo kartalari. O\u2018zbekistonda allaqachon to\u2018lanadigan hammasi.",reason4Title:"Keshbek faqat davra uchun.",reason4Text:"Bonus birga bo\u2018lganda beriladi. Yolg\u2018iz \u2014 hisoblanmaydi.",stripTitle:"Davralar qayerga borishni tanlaydi.",stripTitleAccent:"ZAP! qayerda foydaliroq ekanini ko\u2018rsatadi.",stripSub:"Hamkor joylar promoni o\u2018zi to\u2018laydi \u2014 siz shu chek uchun ko\u2018proq olasiz.",card1Sub:"pitsa \xb7 Toshkent",card1Badge:"KESHBEK \xd72 \xb7 DU-PA \xb7 BUTUN GURUHGA",card2Sub:"fastfud \xb7 tarmoq",card2Badge:"3 KISHIDAN",card3Sub:"o\u2018zbek taomlari",card3Badge:"KESHBEK \xd72 \xb7 KUN BO\u2018YI",card4Sub:"nonvoyxona \xb7 kofe",card4Badge:"30 SEN GACHA \xb7 3 KISHIDAN",card5Sub:"yetkazib berish va zal",card5Badge:"2 KISHIDAN",merchKicker:"joylar uchun",merchTitle:"Guruh trafigi \u2014 faqat fakt bo\u2018yicha to\u2018lanadi.",merchFeeText:"haqiqiy splitdan komissiya. Abonent to\u2018lovi yo\u2018q.",merchKit:"QR-TO\u2018PLAM",merchKitText:"stol tentlari va stikerlar